{"id":"e4d9ab0f9e9545c9","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-Lomega1omega-no-compactness.md","title":"L {ω₁ω} Lacks Compactness","display":"thm-Lomega1omega-no-compactness — L_{ω₁ω} Lacks Compactness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-Lomega1omega-no-compactness","aliases":["57-thm-Lomega1omega-no-compactness"],"display":"thm-Lomega1omega-no-compactness — L_{ω₁ω} Lacks Compactness","depends_on":["[[57-df-compactness-property]]","[[57-df-first-order-language]]","[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]","[[57-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-Lomega1omega-no-compactness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-Lomega1omega-no-compactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-Lomega1omega-no-compactness — L_{ω₁ω} Lacks Compactness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"348361ab4be85a8d\" href=\"?note=348361ab4be85a8d\" title=\"57-df-compactness-property\">57-df-compactness-property</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"140b30594fbd26d8\" href=\"?note=140b30594fbd26d8\" title=\"57-df-first-order-language\">57-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7a465cae4692d50e\" href=\"?note=7a465cae4692d50e\" title=\"57-df-Lomega1omega\">57-df-Lomega1omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-Lomega1omega-no-compactness-—-$L_{\\omega_1\\omega}$-Lacks-Compactness\">thm-Lomega1omega-no-compactness — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\omega_1\\omega}\">\\(L_{\\omega_1\\omega}\\)</span> Lacks Compactness</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的唯一非逻辑符号为二元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S&#39;\">\\(S&#39;\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 上加入两列互异新常量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(c_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((c_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(d_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((d_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>；集合合取、析取及句子语义取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7a465cae4692d50e\" href=\"?note=7a465cae4692d50e\" title=\"57-df-Lomega1omega\">57-df-Lomega1omega</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{\\mathrm{wf}}\">\\(\\sigma_{\\mathrm{wf}}\\)</span> 下式指定载体恰由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_n\">\\(d_n\\)</span> 枚举且序型为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>，不是声称一般良基性可由一个无穷句子定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S&#39;)\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S&#39;)\\)</span>。作为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"348361ab4be85a8d\" href=\"?note=348361ab4be85a8d\" title=\"57-df-compactness-property\">57-df-compactness-property</a> 的语义表示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\omega_1\\omega}\">\\(L_{\\omega_1\\omega}\\)</span> 的句子域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}\\)</span>，真值取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_\\infty\">\\(\\models_\\infty\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma_{\\mathrm{wf}}\\coloneqq\\bigwedge\\Bigl(&amp;\\{\\forall x\\bigvee\\{x\\doteq d_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\neg(d_n\\doteq d_m):n&lt;m&lt;\\omega\\}\\cup\\{d_n&lt;d_m:n&lt;m&lt;\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\neg(d_n&lt;d_m):m\\le n&lt;\\omega\\}\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\Phi&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma_{\\mathrm{wf}}\\}\\cup\\{c_{n+1}&lt;c_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma_{\\mathrm{wf}}\\coloneqq\\bigwedge\\Bigl(&amp;\\{\\forall x\\bigvee\\{x\\doteq d_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\neg(d_n\\doteq d_m):n&lt;m&lt;\\omega\\}\\cup\\{d_n&lt;d_m:n&lt;m&lt;\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\neg(d_n&lt;d_m):m\\le n&lt;\\omega\\}\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\Phi&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma_{\\mathrm{wf}}\\}\\cup\\{c_{n+1}&lt;c_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left[\\forall\\Phi_0\\subseteq\\Phi\\;\\left(|\\Phi_0|&lt;\\aleph_0\\to\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S&#39;}\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\Phi_0)\\right)\\right]\\land\\neg\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S&#39;}\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\Phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left[\\forall\\Phi_0\\subseteq\\Phi\\;\\left(|\\Phi_0|&lt;\\aleph_0\\to\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S&#39;}\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\Phi_0)\\right)\\right]\\land\\neg\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S&#39;}\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\Phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Compact}(L_{\\omega_1\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\mathrm{Compact}(L_{\\omega_1\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原 σ_wf 未给公式，c_n 也不在声明的语言内。这里保留下降链见证思路，补齐常量扩张和一个确实属于 Lω₁ω、强制 ω 序型的明确句子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-Lomega1omega-no-compactness-—-$L_{\\omega_1\\omega}$-Lacks-Compactness","text":"thm-Lomega1omega-no-compactness — $L_{\\omega_1\\omega}$ Lacks Compactness","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-compactness-property","status":"resolved","id":"348361ab4be85a8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-compactness-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"140b30594fbd26d8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-Lomega1omega","status":"resolved","id":"7a465cae4692d50e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-Lomega1omega","status":"resolved","id":"7a465cae4692d50e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 的唯一非逻辑符号为二元 $<$；$S'$ 在 $S$ 上加入两列互异新常量 $(c_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$、$(d_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$。$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$；集合合取、析取及句子语义取 [[57-df-Lomega1omega]]。$\\sigma_{\\mathrm{wf}}$ 下式指定载体恰由 $d_n$ 枚举且序型为 $\\omega$，不是声称一般良基性可由一个无穷句子定义。$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S')$。作为 [[57-df-compactness-property]] 的语义表示，$L_{\\omega_1\\omega}$ 的句子域为 $\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}$，真值取 $\\models_\\infty$。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-compactness-property","status":"resolved","id":"348361ab4be85a8d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 的唯一非逻辑符号为二元 $<$；$S'$ 在 $S$ 上加入两列互异新常量 $(c_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$、$(d_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$。$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$；集合合取、析取及句子语义取 [[57-df-Lomega1omega]]。$\\sigma_{\\mathrm{wf}}$ 下式指定载体恰由 $d_n$ 枚举且序型为 $\\omega$，不是声称一般良基性可由一个无穷句子定义。$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S')$。作为 [[57-df-compactness-property]] 的语义表示，$L_{\\omega_1\\omega}$ 的句子域为 $\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}$，真值取 $\\models_\\infty$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L_{\\omega_1\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"<","display":false},{"tex":"S'","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"(c_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"(d_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_{\\mathrm{wf}}","display":false},{"tex":"d_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S')","display":false},{"tex":"L_{\\omega_1\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma_{\\mathrm{wf}}\\coloneqq\\bigwedge\\Bigl(&\\{\\forall x\\bigvee\\{x\\doteq d_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\neg(d_n\\doteq d_m):n<m<\\omega\\}\\cup\\{d_n<d_m:n<m<\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\neg(d_n<d_m):m\\le n<\\omega\\}\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\Phi&\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma_{\\mathrm{wf}}\\}\\cup\\{c_{n+1}<c_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\left[\\forall\\Phi_0\\subseteq\\Phi\\;\\left(|\\Phi_0|<\\aleph_0\\to\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S'}\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\Phi_0)\\right)\\right]\\land\\neg\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S'}\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\Phi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{Compact}(L_{\\omega_1\\omega}).","display":true}],"bytes":1847,"backlinks":[{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-242","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-thm-Lomega1omega-downward-LS]]\n[[57-thm-Lomega1omega-interpolation]]\n[[57-thm-Lomega1omega-no-compactness]]\n